{
  "_description": "MOSPI PLFS API code dictionary: query-parameter codes and the 8 indicators for https://api.mospi.gov.in/api/plfs/getData",
  "_sourceWorkbook": "PLFS Metadata.xlsx (supplied by MoSPI)",
  "_endpoint": "https://api.mospi.gov.in/api/plfs/getData",
  "_notes": [
    "All India is state_code 99.",
    "year_type has only Agriculture Year (1) and Calendar Year (2); the API no longer serves the Financial-Year survey rounds (2017-18..2023-24) that the frozen mospi.IN.plfs.* series use.",
    "Default page size is 10; responses paginate (meta_data.totalPages). Pass limit=1000 and page=N.",
    "The host requires legacy TLS renegotiation; see memory plfs-api-tls-and-calendar-year.",
    "religion in the API is only all/Hindu/Islam/Christian/Sikh (no Buddhist/Jain)."
  ],
